        "reasoning_opaque": "***REDACTED***",
        "reasoning_text": "The user wants me to run a Python script that collects health data from the dotnet/machinelearning repository using gh api commands. Let me break down what the script does:\n\n1. Creates a health-data directory\n2. Calculates the date from 7 days ago\n3. Runs multiple gh api commands to fetch various data about issues, PRs, CI/CD runs, etc.\n4. Saves the results to JSON files\n5. Generates summary statistics\n\nI need to:\n1. Create and save the Python script\n2. Run it\n3. Report the results\n\nLet me first create the script file and then execute it.",
