            "function": {
              "arguments": "{\"file_text\":\"# GitHub API Endpoints Reference\\n## dotnet/machinelearning Repository Health Data\\n\\nThis document lists all 20 API endpoints used for health data collection.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Management Metrics (M)\\n\\n### M1: Untriaged Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=untriaged&state=open&sort=created&direction=desc&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=untriaged`: Filter by untriaged label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `sort=created`: Sort by creation date\\n- `direction=desc`: Newest first\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results per request\\n\\n**Returns:** Issues needing initial review and categorization\\n\\n---\\n\\n### M2: Awaiting User Input\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=Awaiting+User+Input&state=open&per_page=50\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=Awaiting+User+Input`: Filter by awaiting input label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=50`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Issues waiting for user response or clarification\\n\\n---\\n\\n### M3: Questions\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=question&state=open&sort=created&direction=asc&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=question`: Filter by question label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `sort=created`: Sort by creation date\\n- `direction=asc`: Oldest first\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Community questions and discussions\\n\\n---\\n\\n### M4: Open Pull Requests\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/pulls?state=open&sort=created&direction=asc&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `state=open`: Only open PRs\\n- `sort=created`: Sort by creation date\\n- `direction=asc`: Oldest first (longest waiting)\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Open pull requests waiting for review\\n\\n---\\n\\n### M5: Recently Updated Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?state=open&sort=updated&direction=desc&per_page=50\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `sort=updated`: Sort by last update\\n- `direction=desc`: Most recently updated first\\n- `per_page=50`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Issues with recent activity\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Workflow Metrics (W)\\n\\n### W1: Failed CI Runs\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/actions/runs?branch=main&status=failure&per_page=50\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `branch=main`: Filter by main branch\\n- `status=failure`: Only failed runs\\n- `per_page=50`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Failed workflow executions on main branch\\n\\n---\\n\\n### W2: All CI Runs\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/actions/runs?branch=main&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `branch=main`: Filter by main branch\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** All workflow runs (all statuses) on main branch\\n\\n---\\n\\n### W3: Cancelled Runs\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/actions/runs?branch=main&status=cancelled&per_page=20\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `branch=main`: Filter by main branch\\n- `status=cancelled`: Only cancelled runs\\n- `per_page=20`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Cancelled workflow executions\\n\\n---\\n\\n### W4a: Blocking CI Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=blocking-clean-ci&state=open&per_page=10\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=blocking-clean-ci`: Filter by blocking-clean-ci label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=10`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Issues that block clean CI/CD execution\\n\\n---\\n\\n### W4b: Known Build Errors\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=Known+Build+Error&state=open&per_page=10\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=Known+Build+Error`: Filter by Known Build Error label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=10`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Issues documenting known build failures\\n\\n---\\n\\n### W4c: Main Branch Commit Status\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/commits/main/status\\n```\\n**Parameters:** None (path parameter is branch name)\\n\\n**Returns:** Combined status of all checks on latest main commit\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Critical Issues (C)\\n\\n### C1a: P0 Priority Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=P0&state=open&per_page=20\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=P0`: Filter by P0 priority label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=20`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Critical priority issues requiring immediate attention\\n\\n---\\n\\n### C1b: P1 Priority Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=P1&state=open&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=P1`: Filter by P1 priority label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** High priority issues for near-term work\\n\\n---\\n\\n### C2: Bug Reports\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=bug&state=open&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=bug`: Filter by bug label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Open bug reports\\n\\n---\\n\\n### C5: Security Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=Security&state=open&per_page=20\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=Security`: Filter by Security label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=20`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Security-related issues and vulnerabilities\\n\\n---\\n\\n### C7a: Recent Issues (Last 7 Days)\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?state=all&sort=created&direction=desc&per_page=100&since=YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `state=all`: Both open and closed\\n- `sort=created`: Sort by creation date\\n- `direction=desc`: Newest first\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n- `since=YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ`: Only issues created after this date (7 days ago)\\n\\n**Note:** `since` parameter must be calculated as current_time - 7 days in ISO 8601 format\\n\\n**Returns:** Issues created in the last 7 days\\n\\n---\\n\\n### C7b: Recently Closed Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?state=closed&sort=updated&direction=desc&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `state=closed`: Only closed issues\\n- `sort=updated`: Sort by last update\\n- `direction=desc`: Most recently updated first\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Recently closed issues (resolution velocity)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### C7c: Recently Closed PRs\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/pulls?state=closed&sort=updated&direction=desc&per_page=100\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `state=closed`: Only closed PRs\\n- `sort=updated`: Sort by last update\\n- `direction=desc`: Most recently updated first\\n- `per_page=100`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Recently closed pull requests (merge rate)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Repository Information\\n\\n### Repo Info: Repository Metadata\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning\\n```\\n**Parameters:** None\\n\\n**Returns:** Repository metadata including:\\n- Stars, watchers, forks\\n- Language, topics\\n- License, visibility\\n- Created/updated dates\\n- Issue counts\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Health Dashboard: Repo-Health Issues\\n**Endpoint:**\\n```\\nGET /repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?labels=repo-health&state=open&per_page=5\\n```\\n**Parameters:**\\n- `labels=repo-health`: Filter by repo-health label\\n- `state=open`: Only open issues\\n- `per_page=5`: Maximum results\\n\\n**Returns:** Issues tracked in repository health dashboard\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Common API Response Formats\\n\\n### Issue/PR Object\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/1234\\\",\\n  \\\"number\\\": 1234,\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Issue title\\\",\\n  \\\"user\\\": {\\n    \\\"login\\\": \\\"username\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": 12345,\\n    \\\"avatar_url\\\": \\\"https://...\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"labels\\\": [\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"bug\\\", \\\"color\\\": \\\"fc2929\\\"},\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"P1\\\", \\\"color\\\": \\\"fbca04\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  \\\"state\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2024-01-15T10:00:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2024-03-04T14:30:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"closed_at\\\": null,\\n  \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n  \\\"assignees\\\": [],\\n  \\\"milestone\\\": null,\\n  \\\"body\\\": \\\"Issue description...\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Workflow Run Object\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"id\\\": 12345678,\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Build\\\",\\n  \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"WFR_...\\\",\\n  \\\"head_branch\\\": \\\"main\\\",\\n  \\\"head_sha\\\": \\\"abc123def456...\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n  \\\"conclusion\\\": \\\"failure\\\",\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2024-03-04T12:00:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2024-03-04T12:15:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"run_number\\\": 2024,\\n  \\\"event\\\": \\\"push\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Commit Status Object\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"state\\\": \\\"failure\\\",\\n  \\\"sha\\\": \\\"abc123def456...\\\",\\n  \\\"total_count\\\": 5,\\n  \\\"statuses\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://...\\\",\\n      \\\"state\\\": \\\"success\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Build passed\\\",\\n      \\\"context\\\": \\\"continuous-integration/build\\\",\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2024-03-04T12:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2024-03-04T12:10:00Z\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Rate Limiting\\n\\n**Standard Rate Limit:** 5,000 requests per hour (per user)\\n\\n**Headers returned:**\\n```\\nX-RateLimit-Limit: 5000\\nX-RateLimit-Remaining: 4980\\nX-RateLimit-Reset: 1234567890\\n```\\n\\n**Check your rate limit:**\\n```bash\\ngh api rate_limit\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Authentication\\n\\nAll endpoints require authentication. Use one of:\\n\\n1. **GitHub CLI (Recommended):**\\n   ```bash\\n   gh auth login\\n   ```\\n\\n2. **Personal Access Token (PAT):**\\n   ```bash\\n   export GH_TOKEN=\\\"your_token_here\\\"\\n   gh api /repos/dotnet/machinelearning\\n   ```\\n\\n3. **Environment Variables:**\\n   ```bash\\n   export GITHUB_TOKEN=\\\"your_token_here\\\"\\n   ```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Useful Links\\n\\n- **GitHub REST API Docs:** https://docs.github.com/en/rest\\n- **GitHub CLI Docs:** https://cli.github.com/manual\\n- **Repository:** https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning\\n- **Issue Tracker:** https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues\\n- **GitHub API Status:** https://www.githubstatus.com/\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Tips\\n\\n1. **Pagination:** Use `per_page` parameter to control results\\n2. **Sorting:** Use `sort` and `direction` for different orderings\\n3. **Filtering:** Combine multiple labels with `+` (URL encoded)\\n4. **Date Format:** Always use ISO 8601 UTC format (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ)\\n5. **Caching:** Consider caching results if running frequently\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Last Updated:** 2024-03-04\\n**API Version:** REST API v3\\n**GitHub CLI Compatible:** Yes (v2.0+)\\n\",\"path\":\"/home/runner/work/GH-AW-Tests/GH-AW-Tests/API_ENDPOINTS_REFERENCE.md\"}",
